{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":18.56},{"sectionId":"build","start":19.64,"end":37.6},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.4,"end":51.28}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.96,"text":"JavaScript 監聽事件並更新文件。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.08,"end":6.64,"text":"按鈕已有實用的鍵盤操作行為，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.88,"end":9.12,"text":"可以直接加入 click 監聽，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.4,"end":11.52,"text":"不必自行建立焦點系統。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.4,"end":15.76,"text":"插入一般文字時使用 textContent，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":16.08,"end":18.56,"text":"它不會把字串解讀為標記。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":19.64,"end":20.72,"text":"在 /interaction."},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.96,"end":25.28,"text":"js 把事件名稱 mouseenter 改成 click。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.4,"end":29.04,"text":"用滑鼠啟動 顯示聯絡資訊，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.4,"end":32.56,"text":"再讓按鈕取得焦點並按 Enter。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":34.2,"end":37.6,"text":"為什麼在真正的 button 上監聽 click 很實用？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.4,"end":42.96,"text":"為什麼在真正的 button 上監聽 click 很實用？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.4,"end":48.16,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":48.8,"end":51.28,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}